WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:04.371
Aria answers every call, even when you can't.

2
00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:08.138
When you're on a job or it's after hours, calls go unanswered.

3
00:00:08.238 --> 00:00:11.574
And most callers just try the next company on the list.

4
00:00:11.674 --> 00:00:14.805
Aria picks up in your business name, day or night.

5
00:00:14.905 --> 00:00:18.711
She answers questions from a script and FAQs we write with you.

6
00:00:18.811 --> 00:00:22.154
Then she books the job or takes down the details.

7
00:00:22.254 --> 00:00:25.985
After every call, you get a short summary by text and email.

8
00:00:26.085 --> 00:00:30.111
And the lead goes straight into your ticketing, so nothing gets lost.

9
00:00:30.834 --> 00:00:34.872
Knight Logics. Book a call at knightlogics.com.

